@baseUrl = https://localhost:7081
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ACCESS_TOKEN
### Vida sin consultar SQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
### Dependencias; 503 mientras no esté habilitada identidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
### Registro (requiere SQL Server y migraciones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ana","lastName":"Pérez","email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}
### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}
### Perfil propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Reemplazar perfil editable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ana María","lastName":"Pérez"}

### Creo mi billetera ARS; sin cuerpo. Repetir devuelve la existente.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consulto mi billetera y saldo actual; 404 si todavía no la creé.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Transfiero ARS; conservo la clave al reintentar la misma intención.
@destinationWalletId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_UUID_BILLETERA_DESTINO
@transferKey = REEMPLAZAR_POR_UUID_DE_LA_OPERACION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{transferKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"destinationWalletId":"{{destinationWalletId}}","amount":300.00}

### Consulto mi historial; para continuar uso el nextCursor recibido.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/me/movements?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Configuración pública de cargas (no devuelve secretos).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preparo una carga sandbox; conservo esta clave para recuperar la misma intención.
@paymentKey = REEMPLAZAR_POR_UUID_DE_LA_CARGA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{paymentKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":1000.00}

### Consulto el estado persistido; el retorno del navegador no acredita saldo.
@paymentId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ID_LOCAL_DE_LA_CARGA
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consulto Mercado Pago y reconcilio la misma operación. No inicio otro checkout.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
